verses.text:
He changes times and seasons;
he removes kings and sets up kings;
he gives wisdom to the wise
and knowledge to those who have understanding.

He uncovers deep and secret matters;
he knows what is hidden in darkness,
and light lives with him.

I issue a decree that throughout all the dominion of my kingdom people shall tremble and fear before Daniel’s God,
for he is the living God,
and he endures forever;
his kingdom is one that will not be destroyed,
and his rule will last to the end.

He will say hostile words against the Most High
and wear out the holy ones who belong to the Most High;
he will intend to change the seasons and the law,
and for a time, times and half a time
the holy ones will be under his control.{g}

And many of those who sleep in the dust of the earth will awake,
some to everlasting life,
and some to disgrace and everlasting contempt.{a}
